(module asl-transpile/transpileTest :x [testJsonToAsnObject testJsonToAsnArray testAsnToJson testYamlToAsn testAsnToYaml testHtmlToVdomAsn testVdomAsnToHtml testMeasureSavings testEmptyAndMalformed runTests] :i [(asl-transpile/transpile :a tr)])

fn testJsonToAsnObject -> Bool
  (let [(res (tr/jsonToAsn "{\"model\": \"qwen\", \"tokens\": 1200, \"active\": true}")) (resNum (tr/jsonToAsn "{\"count\": -42, \"ratio\": 3.14, \"large\": 999999}")) (resStr (tr/jsonToAsn "{\"desc\": \"step 1: host, port 8080\", \"tags\": \"a, b: {c}\"}")) (resNest (tr/jsonToAsn "{\"user\": {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"role\": \"admin\"}, \"score\": 100}")) (resBad (tr/jsonToAsn "not an object"))] (assert res.success "json to asn object succeeds") (assert (stringContains? res.output "(:model \"qwen\"") "output contains model") (assert (>= res.savingsPercent 30.0) "savings >= 30%") (assert resNum.success "negative and float numbers succeed") (assert (stringContains? resNum.output ":count -42") "contains negative int") (assert (stringContains? resNum.output ":ratio 3.14") "contains float") (assert resStr.success "strings with punctuation succeed") (assert (stringContains? resStr.output "\"step 1: host, port 8080\"") "preserves punctuation inside string") (assert resNest.success "nested objects succeed") (assert (stringContains? resNest.output "(:user (:name \"Alice\" :role \"admin\") :score 100)") "nested record matches ASN") (assert (not resBad.success) "reject non-object json root") true)

fn testJsonToAsnArray -> Bool
  (let [(res (tr/jsonToAsn "[1, 2, 3]")) (resObjs (tr/jsonToAsn "[{\"id\": 1}, {\"id\": 2}]")) (resMixed (tr/jsonToAsn "[1, \"two\", true, null, -5.5]")) (resBad (tr/jsonToAsn "not an array"))] (assert res.success "json to asn array succeeds") (assert (stringContains? res.output "[1 2 3]") "output contains array elements") (assert resObjs.success "array of objects succeeds") (assert (stringContains? resObjs.output "[(:id 1) (:id 2)]") "array of records matches ASN") (assert resMixed.success "heterogeneous array succeeds") (assert (stringContains? resMixed.output "[1 \"two\" true _ -5.5]") "mixed elements match ASN") (assert (not resBad.success) "reject non-array json root") true)

fn testAsnToJson -> Bool
  (let [(res1 (tr/asnToJson "(:model \"qwen\" :tokens 2048 :active true)")) (res2 (tr/asnToJson "[1 2 3]")) (resNeg (tr/asnToJson "(:desc \"step 1: test 2\" :count -42 :ratio 3.14 :active false :empty _)")) (resNest (tr/asnToJson "(:user (:name \"Alice\" :active true) :items [1 2 3])")) (resBad (tr/asnToJson "not an asn"))] (assert res1.success "asn to json record succeeds") (assert (stringContains? res1.output "\"model\": \"qwen\"") "contains model") (assert (stringContains? res1.output "\"tokens\": 2048") "contains tokens") (assert res2.success "asn to json vector succeeds") (assert (stringContains? res2.output "[1, 2, 3]") "contains vector elements") (assert resNeg.success "asn with negatives and strings succeeds") (assert (stringContains? resNeg.output "\"desc\": \"step 1: test 2\"") "string content with digits not corrupted") (assert (stringContains? resNeg.output "\"count\": -42") "negative number serialized") (assert (stringContains? resNeg.output "\"ratio\": 3.14") "float serialized") (assert (stringContains? resNeg.output "\"empty\": null") "nil serialized to null") (assert resNest.success "nested asn record succeeds") (assert (stringContains? resNest.output "\"user\": {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"active\": true}") "nested record serialized to json object") (assert (stringContains? resNest.output "\"items\": [1, 2, 3]") "nested vector serialized to json array") (assert (not resBad.success) "reject invalid asn root") true)

fn testYamlToAsn -> Bool
  (let [(res (tr/yamlToAsn "model: qwen\ntokens: 1200")) (resBad (tr/yamlToAsn ""))] (assert res.success "yaml to asn succeeds") (assert (stringContains? res.output "(:model qwen") "output contains model") (assert (not resBad.success) "reject empty yaml") true)

fn testAsnToYaml -> Bool
  (let [(res (tr/asnToYaml "(:model qwen :tokens 1200)")) (resBad (tr/asnToYaml ""))] (assert res.success "asn to yaml succeeds") (assert (stringContains? res.output "model: qwen") "output contains model") (assert (not resBad.success) "reject empty asn") true)

fn testHtmlToVdomAsn -> Bool
  (let [(res (tr/htmlToVdomAsn "<div class=\"btn\"><img src=\"logo.png\"><span>Click</span></div>")) (resTbl (tr/htmlToVdomAsn "<table><thead><tr><th>Name</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Alice</td></tr></tbody></table>")) (resForm (tr/htmlToVdomAsn "<form action=\"/api\" method=\"post\"><label>User</label><input type=\"text\" name=\"user\" required/><button type=\"submit\" disabled>Send</button></form>")) (resMixed (tr/htmlToVdomAsn "<p>Hello <b>world</b>!</p>")) (resVoid (tr/htmlToVdomAsn "<img src=\"avatar.png\" alt=\"pic\"/><br/><hr/>")) (resBad (tr/htmlToVdomAsn "not an html")) (resEmpty (tr/htmlToVdomAsn ""))] (assert res.success "html to vdom succeeds") (assert (stringContains? res.output "(div (:class \"btn\")") "contains div class") (assert (stringContains? res.output "(img (:src \"logo.png\"))") "contains img tag") (assert resTbl.success "table hierarchy succeeds") (assert (stringContains? resTbl.output "(table (thead") "contains table thead") (assert (stringContains? resTbl.output "(td \"Alice\")") "contains table data") (assert resForm.success "form and boolean attributes succeed") (assert (stringContains? resForm.output ":action \"/api\"") "contains form action") (assert (stringContains? resForm.output ":required true") "contains boolean attribute required") (assert (stringContains? resForm.output ":disabled true") "contains boolean attribute disabled") (assert resMixed.success "mixed inline elements succeed") (assert (stringContains? resMixed.output "(b \"world\")") "contains inline bold element") (assert resVoid.success "void elements without closing tags succeed") (assert (stringContains? resVoid.output "(br)") "contains br void element") (assert (stringContains? resVoid.output "(hr)") "contains hr void element") (assert (not resBad.success) "reject non-html input") (assert (not resEmpty.success) "reject empty input") true)

fn testVdomAsnToHtml -> Bool
  (let [(res (tr/vdomAsnToHtml "(div (:class \"btn\") (span \"Click\"))")) (resTbl (tr/vdomAsnToHtml "(table (tr (th \"A\") (th \"B\")) (tr (td \"1\") (td \"2\")))")) (resForm (tr/vdomAsnToHtml "(form (:action \"/api\") (input (:type \"text\")) (button (:disabled true) \"Submit\"))")) (resVoid (tr/vdomAsnToHtml "(div (img (:src \"logo.png\")) (br) (hr))")) (resBad (tr/vdomAsnToHtml "not a vdom")) (resEmpty (tr/vdomAsnToHtml ""))] (assert res.success "vdom to html succeeds") (assert (stringContains? res.output "<div class=\"btn\"><span>Click</span></div>") "output matches html") (assert resTbl.success "table serialization succeeds") (assert (stringContains? resTbl.output "<table><tr><th>A</th><th>B</th></tr>") "table markup matches") (assert resForm.success "form with boolean attribute succeeds") (assert (stringContains? resForm.output "<button disabled>Submit</button>") "boolean attribute rendered cleanly") (assert resVoid.success "void elements rendered self-closing") (assert (stringContains? resVoid.output "<br/>") "br self-closing") (assert (stringContains? resVoid.output "<hr/>") "hr self-closing") (assert (not resBad.success) "reject invalid vdom root") (assert (not resEmpty.success) "reject empty input") true)

fn testMeasureSavings -> Bool
  (let [(payload "{\"package\": \"asl-harness\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"description\": \"Universal Agent Harness with Cognitive Gateway\", \"active\": true}") (res (tr/measureTranspileSavings payload "json")) (resBad (tr/measureTranspileSavings "" "json"))] (assert res.success "measure savings succeeds") (assert (>= res.savingsPercent 45.0) "savings >= 45%") (assert (not resBad.success) "reject empty payload in savings measurement") true)

fn testEmptyAndMalformed -> Bool
  (let [(rEmpty (tr/jsonToAsn "")) (rMalformed (tr/htmlToVdomAsn "not an html")) (rValid (tr/jsonToAsn "{\"valid\": true}"))] (assert rValid.success "valid json succeeds") (assert (not rEmpty.success) "empty json rejected") (assert (not rMalformed.success) "malformed html rejected") true)

fn runTests -> Bool
  (do (assert (testJsonToAsnObject) "json to asn object") (assert (testJsonToAsnArray) "json to asn array") (assert (testAsnToJson) "asn to json") (assert (testYamlToAsn) "yaml to asn") (assert (testAsnToYaml) "asn to yaml") (assert (testHtmlToVdomAsn) "html to vdom") (assert (testVdomAsnToHtml) "vdom to html") (assert (testMeasureSavings) "measure savings") (assert (testEmptyAndMalformed) "empty and malformed") true)
